    /src/main.rs                       false        RootDir Normal(src) Normal(main.rs)
    \\fileserver\share\plan.md         true         Prefix(UNC("fileserver", "share")) RootDir Normal(plan.md)
    C:work\plan.md                     false        Prefix(Disk(67)) Normal(work) Normal(plan.md)
    src\main.rs                        false        Normal(src) Normal(main.rs)
    C:\                                true         Prefix(Disk(67)) RootDir
    \                                  false        RootDir
    //fileserver/share/plan.md         true         Prefix(UNC("fileserver", "share")) RootDir Normal(plan.md)
    ~/x                                false        Normal(~) Normal(x)

`has_root` without `is_absolute` for four of these, which is section 2's gap in one printout, and both
separatives (`\src` and `/src`) fall in it. Table 2 is the tail the old code fell through to, i.e. the
